Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Pesci, what the hell\Nare you doing? Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop this train right now, Pesci!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.58,0:01:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.68,0:01:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop this train!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.82,0:01:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro, but I don't know\Nthe first thing about
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.70,0:02:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,stopping trains in a\Nmatter of moments you and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power will be but a memory after that
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.56,0:02:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll save my team and\NI'll keep protecting Trish
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.14,0:02:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.72,0:02:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.44,0:02:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let this prick\Ntake you away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That was marvelous work, Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your quick-fire thinking\Nprevented a nasty end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about a close one!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.24,0:02:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He was almost a goner, but I\Nsnagged him at the last second,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and now that he's on my hook,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,he's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.02,0:02:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But it feels like I've got two bodies\Ndangling off the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.36,0:02:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be Pucurati.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.18,0:02:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He didn't bite it when they fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a formidable adversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,My life started to flash\Nbefore my eyes just then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:02:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I said something to the\Neffect of you being a lousy Cape,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but I take it all back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.84,0:03:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That was said in poor taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.24,0:03:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I see now you make decisions\Nwith a fair and impartial eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.26,0:03:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your crew's lives are\Nas valuable as your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.20,0:03:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The more we duke it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.72,0:03:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,the more apparent it is\Nthe boss was right to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.80,0:03:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,leave his estranged daughter\Nin your capable hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.52,0:03:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you've left quite\Na strong impression.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.38,0:03:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,However, Bucciarati, your\Nluck as a Cape just ran out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.52,0:03:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so eager to leap\Nfrom this train before!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.98,0:03:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy your ride\Nto the afterlife! Superman!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Superman!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My aging powers are still thrusting\Nyou into an early retirement!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.02,0:03:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.78,0:03:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.94,0:03:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to your younger brother's freaky\Nfishing line, my life has been spared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.49,0:03:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He wasn't aiming for me in the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I be the unlucky one in all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.92,0:03:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at what happened with Mista.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle he still has a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I unloaded three bullets\Nstraight into his skull,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.14,0:04:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,yet somehow the stronzo\Nis still drawing breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.04,0:04:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,None of this makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.16,0:04:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if the sun suddenly\Nstarted rising in the west!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him everything he needs to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The energy from an attack\Ndealt on the fishing
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,line goes straight back\Nto the one on the hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.60,0:04:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, my load just got\Na hell of a lot lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I lost that douche, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.56,0:04:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it, Prosciutto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,We slaughtered that punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,His age acceleration\Nis finally wearing off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we just have to\Nfinish off, loser hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.58,0:04:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.24,0:04:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know for a fact that I\Nhooked Big Bro's right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm positive there was\Nnothing else on the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,His pinky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it was on the\Nright side of the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.86,0:05:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's different now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The pinky's on the left side of the hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But how is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd I hook the left hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Something weird's happening out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.84,0:05:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is my Big Bro's left hand hooked now?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.18,0:05:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Would someone make this\Nweird shit make sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.38,0:05:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm freaking the F out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Although now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.48,0:05:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro did feel a teeny\Nbit heavier than normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.80,0:05:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you, it's the fishing pole!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.78,0:05:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta hit the emergency brakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.00,0:05:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This entire train has been infected!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.10,0:05:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All the aches and pains are gone, but\Nsomething still doesn't feel right. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's all better!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.00,0:05:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.62,0:05:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the driver to stop the\Ntrain before we all bite him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.04,0:05:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If all these people are\Nstarting to get better,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.36,0:05:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,then the body that dropped\Nfrom my line must have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.00,0:05:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way it was him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Big Bro, please no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.26,0:05:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm talking here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention or we're\Nall gonna die, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.24,0:06:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Fusuto, say it as it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.00,0:06:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.30,0:06:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.58,0:06:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.18,0:06:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's not around, those guys\Nwill come out of the turtle?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.94,0:06:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's it for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.24,0:06:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.15,0:06:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta think of something!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying like a damn baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Make somebody stop the train, strunzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.46,0:06:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in, Mamoni out of the way if\Nyou won't do anything to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.26,0:06:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to do it myself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.46,0:06:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The aging hasn't stopped after all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But your auntie, you're not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.22,0:06:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.26,0:07:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, big boy. Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.92,0:07:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.94,0:07:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like always, you\Nwere absolutely right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you've caught your target,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.16,0:07:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,your only priority is to hold\Non to them no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.34,0:07:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to keep your stand activated even
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,if it means you end up\Nlosing an arm or a leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Big Bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,With the state he's in, he\Nwon't survive much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.36,0:07:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of time\Nbefore he takes his last breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.86,0:07:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And still he refuses\Nto withdraw his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,A warrior till the bitter end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.20,0:07:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to complete our mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to capture Trish\Nwhatever the personal cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Big Bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.40,0:07:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come too close to the\Nfinish line to turn back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.22,0:07:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.20,0:07:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand, prosciutto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.60,0:08:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You taught me true bravery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't just hear your words now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.02,0:08:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel them in the depths of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.24,0:08:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like you\Nalways told me, big bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When the dark dot comes,\Nthe deed is already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.24,0:08:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking life doesn't feel half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't nearly as scary as\NI thought it was gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And with that, my days of\Nbeing called Mamoni are over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.84,0:08:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll be the pitiless\Npesci of death feared by all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put an end to\Nyou once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.54,0:08:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,While my big bro's powers\Nstill have a little potency.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, you gotta get that hook\Nout of you before he retaliates!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.28,0:09:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you unzipped your hand, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Does this freak somehow have a way of\Nanticipating every move that I make?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can read you like a picture book.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.98,0:09:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My hook's itching to get\Ninside and rip you apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and your wrist is too good\Nan entry point to pass up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.12,0:09:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The hook's shooting up your\Narm like a bat out of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.04,0:09:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd it slip out again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.36,0:09:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Merda!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.27,0:09:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I go to pull it out, he anticipates\Nall my movements to the centimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.50,0:09:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost your mind if you think\NI'll let you get away from me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never let Big Bro Spirit die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll snatch up Trish and complete\Nthe mission in his honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.06,0:09:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Vucerati!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.97,0:09:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The dipshit's down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If we get rid of that guy, Churno and\Nthe other guys will go back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.68,0:09:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, they can take down Po 'boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's easier said than done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're about to get a helping of the\Ntorment and anguish my Big Bro suffered!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Luchirazi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Asshole must have grabbed onto something,\Nwhich would mean that he's climbing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.48,0:10:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're heading right for the power lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.92,0:10:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.68,0:10:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt something hit, but it didn't\Nfeel like a body being bisected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the vibrations of a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.86,0:10:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati is definitely still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.14,0:10:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He got himself back inside the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.28,0:10:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You lucked out, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.56,0:10:53.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The way things are shaking out, we'll have\Nto take down this bastard face to face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.78,0:10:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.69,0:10:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But we don't have the\Nmeans. Not like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.08,0:10:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,We've run out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The hook is already burrowing\Ninto my chest cavity. Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.86,0:11:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My hook is 12 centimeters\Naway from your heart. Whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.44,0:11:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Make that 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I misjudged terribly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The thug with the aging\Npowers was formidable,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but I see now he was\Nnever our greatest threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.56,0:11:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The real terror on the train was\Nhidden behind that innocuous tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.06,0:11:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning\Nto do now, Bucciarati?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.52,0:11:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That hook will skewer your\Nheart before too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.76,0:11:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine away, eight away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.60,0:11:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll have to teach him a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.26,0:11:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to overcome his stand is to\Nmake this Koglione understand something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have Determinazione in spades!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it, Zipperman!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.42,0:12:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a hint of a pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.42,0:12:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't sense any breathing either.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.58,0:12:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.10,0:12:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd I completely lose track of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You're starting to worry me, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we don't have a lot of\Noptions, but this is too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.06,0:12:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Quiet yourself, number six.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.98,0:12:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We must wait till he leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Acts like this are what it means to have.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.38,0:12:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Determination.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.86,0:12:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, he's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,His stand lets him slip off\Nmy hook whenever he wants!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.82,0:12:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He could be anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.46,0:12:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He could ambush me from any angle!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.18,0:12:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.09,0:12:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta pull it together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.58,0:12:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Paranoia is a sign of mental weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.02,0:12:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what Prosciutto would tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Be confident, Pesci.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone can find a hidden heartbeat\Non this speeding death trap from hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.06,0:12:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,it's you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.42,0:12:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way Bucciarati is\Nas mobile as he used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.20,0:13:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet big money that cowardly bastardo\Nis hiding out somewhere near my hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.84,0:13:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The line!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.04,0:13:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He's making it even longer now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.14,0:13:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to put yourself\Nback together and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He still can't tell where I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.44,0:13:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And it'll stay that way as long\Nas I remain perfectly still.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.28,0:13:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now, I have to stay motionless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That proves my resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.74,0:13:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen for the blood\Ncoursing through his veins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Find his beating heart and destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's not the one I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.88,0:13:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The weight's all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.42,0:13:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tourist!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.44,0:13:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fate, but there's no question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.40,0:13:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.62,0:13:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's zeroed in on your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.62,0:13:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Muncherati!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.68,0:14:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You said all you were\Ngonna do was stay still,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.48,0:14:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,not cleave your heart in\Nhalf to stop the vibrations!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Has he lost his mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can live for very long if their\Nheart and lungs don't work, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.76,0:14:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit! Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is silent\Nas a freaking cemetery!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.48,0:14:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Slippery Katsone must have snuck off\Nsomewhere with that zipper of his!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.86,0:14:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've taken this too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.96,0:14:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is this bastard hiding now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.68,0:14:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.59,0:14:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what if that Gazzone Bucciarati\Nreally finished off prosciutto?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.64,0:14:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If my bro's stand is gone, then the\Nguys in the turtle will be after me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:14:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw this noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You messed with the wrong guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.46,0:15:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor idiot gave up and left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.26,0:15:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That determinazione of yours totally\Nthrew the Devi off the trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.56,0:15:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure as hell showed\Nthat guy who's boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now hurry up and zip\Nyour body back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, get a move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.62,0:15:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange life is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.92,0:15:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang in there, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Controlling bullets is\Nthe most I'm able to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,His drive got me totally off guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.90,0:15:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So, he's the victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't this train stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.08,0:15:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.99,0:15:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.34,0:16:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Becbrough, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a train ride from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One that I would not have survived\Nwithout some luck on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.36,0:16:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm happy to say the\Njourney led me right to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll suffer for what\Nyou've done, Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.46,0:16:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah for determinazione!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing my big bro sees before he
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.32,0:16:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,dies will be your corpse\Nthrown into the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.62,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider me impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some sharp peepers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.10,0:16:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That expression.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.60,0:17:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,His eyes look like they've\Nwitnessed years of bloodshed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.06,0:17:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,His composure is downright menacing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.28,0:17:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Simple tricks aren't going to work on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.58,0:17:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.49,0:17:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Glory is yours for the taking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.56,0:17:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Finish him off, Pesci.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.82,0:17:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My time has come, but I'll be\Nwatching you from the next life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.86,0:17:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Make me proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll avenge my bro with your death!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.70,0:17:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's such a predictable move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.28,0:17:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shooting straight up the arm to the\Ncardiac muscle was always my Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that was when I didn't have\Nthe balls to try anything riskier.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.06,0:17:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But now my finisher is an assault\Nstraight to the heart of my prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing will stop me from steamrolling\Nyour brother-killing ass into extinction!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.94,0:18:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rip your heart out and\Ntear it into a million pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You should save the victory speech\Nuntil after you've won the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.42,0:18:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how a true mafiosi does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.52,0:18:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.48,0:18:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really how I bite the big one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.64,0:18:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.18,0:18:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not before I play my ultimate hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.84,0:18:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Take her and run. Wait now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll let her keep her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.02,0:18:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he's got the turtle! What? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.78,0:18:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But before I go, the least I can do\Nis give you a little parting gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The gift of knowing\Nyou failed your Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.18,0:19:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch as I crush this\Nthing into turtle soup!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.86,0:19:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of the group is\Ngonna be smashed to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I admired\Nthat glint in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There was an unrelenting nobility to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.72,0:19:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't see that very often.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pity, it's vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're nothing but a disgraced swine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.82,0:19:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.20,0:19:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.11,0:19:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The only ones falling for grace are\Nyour friends and this damn turtle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy burning in hell, Bucciarati!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.48,0:19:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell you've lived life\Nas the eternal screw-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't change on my account.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,ARRIVA Trish
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fairly obvious we can't\Ntravel by train from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.56,0:20:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.10,0:20:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no telling what they know\Nand who they've told about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.94,0:20:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they've figured out where we're\Ngoing by now, and what the Turtle can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.70,0:20:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to use another form\Nof transportation from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.22,0:20:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to cooperate?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies, but we don't have\Nauthorization to do such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.78,0:20:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You know our mission is\Nonly to safeguard your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.16,0:20:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You will answer my questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:20:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, just who am I really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.98,0:21:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.70,0:21:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it get on the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I want answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.68,0:21:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are these bizarre marks\Nappearing near my feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How did a father I've never even\Nmet turn me into a walking target?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,As I thought, the boss's\Ndaughter is a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.50,0:21:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's currently 6:34 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I arrived at the scene 20\Nminutes after the train stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Prosciutto is dead next to the tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Pesci has been mutilated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.48,0:21:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The pieces are scattered\Nnear the riverbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.20,0:21:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging from the bloodbath here, this must\Nbe the work of Bucciaranti's Zipperman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about his team and the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.92,0:21:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Long gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.22,0:21:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you track him, Melone? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Those two disfigured losers actually\Nmanaged to do something useful for once.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.04,0:22:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got a decent blood sample now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.00,0:22:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,From Bucciarati.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.66,0:22:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get you out of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.78,0:22:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you'll be all I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.30,0:22:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I would give anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to make you understand me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn about nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.74,0:22:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Freaking you is all I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.14,0:22:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I need your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.90,0:23:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.90,0:23:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.64,0:23:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.78,0:23:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a freak in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What must I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.32,0:23:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.86,0:23:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To show how much I'm a freak in you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.90,0:23:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You
